        "original_id": "098f565a-d099-5681-983c-a43c5a28132a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Dream\n- People: Maria Brink\n- Organizations: In This Moment, Loudwire, Yell!\n- Topics: metalcore, clean vocals, harmonization, heavy metal awards\n\nFacts:\n- The Dream is the second album by the American metalcore band In This Moment.\n- The Dream features more clean vocals and harmonization than In This Moment's previous album, rather than emphasizing Maria Brink's high-pitched screams.\n- In 2010, Maria Brink was named \"Hottest Chick in Metal.\"\n- In 2013 and 2015, Loudwire Music Awards named Maria Brink \"Rock Goddess of the Year\" at the 3rd and 5th annual awards.\n- Yell! recognized Maria Brink as one of eleven women in heavy metal who matter.",
